                <pb facs="0722" n="640" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg640"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 417.00/96.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Managua</hi></placeName>,<date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-10-31"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 31, 1911</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 137.]</seg></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to report that on the 14th instant the National Constituent
                    Assembly unanimously approved the decree of the Executive bearing date of the
                    9th instant, and embodying the amendments approved by the Department in its
                    telegram of June 26 to the mixed commission decree of May 17 last. A certified
                    copy of this law is herewith inclosed.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. M. Gunther.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d919-a1.xml" xpointer="d919-a1"/>
